OL,3,GNEWSAFerry passengers hit by data
OL,4,Abreach during sailing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers on a P&O ferry have been hit
OL,7,Fby a data breach after personal
OL,8,Finformation was shared during the
OL,9,Fsailing, the cross-Channel operator has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FP&O Ferries said an "isolated incident"
OL,13,Ftook place on a sailing on the Calais
OL,14,Fto Dover route on Monday when a link
OL,15,Fcontaining personal information
OL,16,Frelating to passengers on the vessel
OL,17,Fwas "inadvertently shared" with several
OL,18,Fother customers.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
