OL,3,GNEWSAFerry passengers hit by data
OL,4,Abreach during sailing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for P&O Ferries said it
OL,7,Fwas contacting customers who had been
OL,8,Faffected and apologised for any
OL,9,Finconvenience.
OL,11,FAn Information Commissioner's Office
OL,12,F(ICO) spokesperson said P&O Ferries had
OL,13,Freported an incident, adding: "We are
OL,14,Fassessing the information provided."
